Project details

## Directory structure

```
src/
├── app/
│   ├── page.tsx              # Public landing page
│   ├── layout.tsx            # Fonts, theme, LibraryProvider, toasts
│   ├── globals.css           # Theme tokens (light/dark) and animation utilities
│   └── (app)/                # Signed-in routes, guarded by (app)/layout.tsx
│       ├── dashboard/  library/  books/[id]/  add-books/
│       ├── statistics/  activity-history/
│       └── wishlist/ (redirect)  progress/  shared/ (coming soon)
├── components/
│   ├── ui.tsx                # Primitives: Button, Card, Input, Badge, Stars, Cover, Dialog, Segmented…
│   ├── shell.tsx             # Header, sidebar, quick search, user menu
│   ├── book-card.tsx  edit-book.tsx  scanner.tsx  volume.tsx  toast.tsx  coming-soon.tsx
└── lib/
    ├── types.ts              # Book, BookEvent, UserProfile, …
    ├── domain.ts             # Pure rules
    ├── insights.ts           # Pure read models
    ├── library.ts            # Firestore commands and watchers
    ├── books-api.ts          # Google Books + ISBN
    ├── ai.ts                 # Gemini prompt + fallbacks
    ├── firebase.ts           # SDK setup (emulator aware)
    ├── store.tsx             # LibraryProvider / useLibrary
    └── use-search-state.ts   # URL-backed filter state
tests/
├── unit/                     # Vitest, incl. fast-check differential tests vs legacy
├── oracle/                   # Legacy vs current against the emulators
└── e2e/                      # Playwright
```

## Data

Firestore layout and every field: `analysis/librarium/DATA_OBJECTS.md`.

```
users/{uid}/profile/main
users/{uid}/books/{bookId}
users/{uid}/events/{eventId}     # append-only history: state, progress, rating, comment, review, edits, deletes
users/{uid}/messages/{messageId} # daily companion messages
```

Reading states move forward only (`not_started → in_progress → finished`); progress updates start and finish books automatically; the edit dialog may set any state.
